<title>GERMANY: Bayernhypo cuts D.Telekom to mkt performer.</title>
<headline>Bayernhypo cuts D.Telekom to mkt performer.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel- Bank AG said on Monday it has cut its rating on shares in telecommunications group Deutsche Telekom AG to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;outperformer&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;The initial opportunity for share price gains was not seized by the market,&quot; said Bayernhypo analyst Roland Pitz.</p>
<p>He added that the bank had not changed its fundamental assessment of the company and that he saw Telekom shares moving between 30-32 marks in the short-term.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097145</p>
</text>
